      "  <span class=\"label-text\">$3</span>",
      "</button>$0"
    ],
    "description": "Floating action button with icon and label for the primary constructive action on a screen.\nVariants: primary-container (default) | secondary-container | tertiary-container | primary | secondary | tertiary\nSizes: small (default) | medium | large"
  },
